<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY 26/27.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY 26/27.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>26/27. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   May 23-26	 May 23-26</p>
<p> CZK	0.44211	   0.43733</p>
<p> DKK	2.10043	   2.10105</p>
<p> FIM	2.65118	   2.65161</p>
<p> HUF	0.07457	   0.7479</p>
<p> JPY	0.0081	    0.11707</p>
<p> LTL	3.37182	   3.38525</p>
<p> LVL     23.77155	  23.84158</p>
<p> RUR	0.00234	   0.00235</p>
<p> SEK	1.77626	   1.78294</p>
<p> UAH	7.26987	   7.30452</p>
<p> USD     13.4856	   13.5444</p>
<p> XEU     15.5725	   15.59976</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
